=== middle_workshop ===
[PLACEHOLDER] Shelves of carved figures, finer than anything you've made. Every chisel has its place.
-> END

=== middle_tube_view ===
[PLACEHOLDER] The tube, close enough to feel its cold light. Up here it seems brighter.
-> END

=== middle_clock ===
[PLACEHOLDER] A blessing that ticks. Its hands creep round, and the family who owns it tells everyone the time.
